OL,3,GNEWSACity urged to declare 'pothole
OL,4,Aemergency'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMounting bills for damage to cars and
OL,7,Fother vehicles has led to calls for a
OL,8,F"pothole emergency" to be declared.
OL,10,FAlmost #40,000 was paid out in
OL,11,Finsurance claims linked to pothole
OL,12,Fdamage to vehicles in the Sunderland
OL,13,FCity Council area in the last financial
OL,14,Fyear, leading opposition councillors to
OL,15,Fclaim motorists were "sick of the state
OL,16,Fof our roads".
OL,18,FBosses at the Reform-led council said
OL,19,Fstaff had carried out more repairs so
OL,20,Ffar in 2026 than in the entirety of
OL,21,F2025, with 12,805 potholes fixed
OL,22,Fbetween 1 January and last week.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
